FILE: pdf_handler.py
PURPOSE: BM25-indexed PDF search with sliding conversation memory for multi-turn PDF Q&A.
IMPORTS: rank_bm25.BM25Okapi, session, llm, dto_models

FUNCTIONS:
  load_pdf_index(pages, session)
    Tokenizes page text; builds BM25Okapi index stored in session.pdf_bm25.

  pdf_search(query, session, top_k=3) -> SearchResult
    Scores pages with BM25, retrieves top-k, injects recent PDF turns + summary into LLM prompt.

  _store_pdf_conversation(query, page_refs, answer, session)
    Same rolling-summary compression as memory.py but for PDF turns.

  _format_recent_pdf_turns(session) -> str
